# 9. Load the transformed data into the PostgreSQL Silver Layer.
# 10. Replace existing Silver records for periods being processed.
#
# SOURCE:
# bronze.ops_safaricom_members_list
#
# DESTINATION:
# silver.ops_safaricom_members_list
################################################################################


